		{
			description: [
				"蚁狮是一种巨型蚂蚁，会出现在&n沙漠&r中。"
				""
				"靠得太近，它会钻入地下并向你发射燃烧的投射物。"
				""
				"要驯服它，你必须悄悄靠近，小心行事。然后喂给它结晶化的血液。"
				""
				"驯服后，该生物将进化为4个阶段，每天循环一次。"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&n&eFirst stage,&r&r it grows some fur which u should shear because u can use its fur to craft items."
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"&n&e第二阶段，&r&r它会变成一个在战斗中助你一臂之力的滚动球体。"
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"&n&e第三阶段，&r&r它会长出翅膀，骑乘时可以滑翔。还新增了俯冲攻击，伤害可观。"
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"&n&e在第四阶段，&r&r它会用獠牙攻击并射出灼热的沙子。"
				"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
				"&7沙漏可用于切换不同阶段！"
